# JasperReports Quick Reference

| Component | Purpose |
|-----------|---------|
| .jrxml | Template source (XML) |
| .jasper | Compiled binary (ship this) |
| .jrprint | Filled report (in-memory) |
| JRBeanCollectionDataSource | Java object data source |
| JasperFillManager | Fill template with data |
| JasperExportManager | Export to PDF/CSV/XLSX |

| Export | Method |
|--------|--------|
| PDF | exportReportToPdf() |
| CSV | exportReportToCsv() |
| XLSX | exportReportToXlsx() |